codex
The paper’s native object is indeed a proper edge-coloring and a Kempe interchange means swapping two colors on one connected component of their induced bicolored subgraph. I’m now checking whether the proofs provide a bounded constructive sequence and whether finding such a sequence has any demonstrated hardness; that distinction will decide between a Track B generator and rejection.
