Then, by Lemma \ref{lem:onesided} (a),
	there is a sequence of interchanges on bicolored paths
	with colors from $\{3,4,5\}$
	which transforms $f$ to a proper $5$-edge coloring $g$, such that $c\notin g(v_j)\cup g(v_{j+1})$
